{"id":"6549d129557f6e53","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space.md","title":"ZFC Measure4 Localizable Measure Space","display":"df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space — ZFC Measure4 Localizable Measure Space","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space","aliases":["58-df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space"],"display":"df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space — ZFC Measure4 Localizable Measure Space","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-measure]]","[[58-df-measure-space]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space — ZFC Measure4 Localizable Measure Space"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca832ed6bc22f728\" href=\"?note=ca832ed6bc22f728\" title=\"58-df-measure\">58-df-measure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,\\Sigma,\\mu\\in V\">\\(X,\\Sigma,\\mu\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83a15c7e9b3817dc\" href=\"?note=83a15c7e9b3817dc\" title=\"58-df-measure-space\">58-df-measure-space</a>)</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4LocalizableMeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4LocalizableMeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}\\)</span> (predicate defined here)</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}localizable\\text{-}measure\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4LocalizableMeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\forall E\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(E)=\\infty\\to\n\\exists F\\in\\Sigma\\;(F\\subseteq E\\land0&lt;\\mu(F)&lt;\\infty)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\\;\\exists B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\\forall C\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mu(A\\setminus C)=0\\bigr)\n\\to\\mu(B\\setminus C)=0\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\n&amp;\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}localizable\\text{-}measure\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4LocalizableMeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\forall E\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(E)=\\infty\\to\n\\exists F\\in\\Sigma\\;(F\\subseteq E\\land0&lt;\\mu(F)&lt;\\infty)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&amp;\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\\;\\exists B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{12em}\\land\\forall C\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mu(A\\setminus C)=0\\bigr)\n\\to\\mu(B\\setminus C)=0\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The first clause is semifiniteness.  The second says that every family of measurable sets has an essential supremum modulo null sets.</li>\n<li>Nullness is stated directly by <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu(\\cdot)=0\">\\(\\mu(\\cdot)=0\\)</span>; no set <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal N_\\mu\">\\(\\mathcal N_\\mu\\)</span> is introduced only informally in the hypotheses.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure","status":"resolved","id":"ca832ed6bc22f728","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-measure-space]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-measure-space","status":"resolved","id":"83a15c7e9b3817dc","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}$ (see [[58-df-measure-space]])","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"X,\\Sigma,\\mu\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4LocalizableMeasureSpace}_S:V^3\\to\\mathsf{Bool}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\n&\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}measure4\\text{-}localizable\\text{-}measure\\text{-}space}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{ZfcMeasure4LocalizableMeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\\\\\n&\\quad\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{MeasureSpace}_S(X,\\Sigma,\\mu)\n\\land\\forall E\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\mu(E)=\\infty\\to\n\\exists F\\in\\Sigma\\;(F\\subseteq E\\land0<\\mu(F)<\\infty)\n\\Bigr)\\\\\n&\\qquad\\land\\forall\\mathcal A\\in\\mathcal P(\\Sigma)\\;\\exists B\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mu(A\\setminus B)=0\\\\\n&\\hspace{12em}\\land\\forall C\\in\\Sigma\\;\\Bigl(\n\\bigl(\\forall A\\in\\mathcal A\\;\\mu(A\\setminus C)=0\\bigr)\n\\to\\mu(B\\setminus C)=0\n\\Bigr)\\Bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\mu(\\cdot)=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal N_\\mu","display":false}],"bytes":1565,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2595","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space.md|58-df-zfc-measure4-localizable-measure-space]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","ca832ed6bc22f728","83a15c7e9b3817dc"]}